<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>God hath not promised we shall not know</l><l>Toil and temptation, trouble and woe;</l><l>He hath not told us we shall not bear</l><l>Many a burden, many a care.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>God hath not promised smooth roads and wide,</l><l>Swift, easy travel, needing no guide;</l><l>Never a mountain, rocky and steep,</l><l>Never a river, turbid and deep.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
